# CI/CD

**CI/CD** คือ automation ของ software delivery: **CI** รวมและทดสอบโค้ดบ่อย ๆ, **CD** ส่งต่อ artifact ไป staging/production โดยแบ่งเป็น **Continuous Delivery** (ต้องอนุมัติก่อน production) และ **Continuous Deployment** (deploy อัตโนมัติเมื่อผ่าน gate) [3466][3467][3476]

## Pipeline Stages

```text
Source → Build → Test → Security → Package → Deploy → Verify → Monitor
```

| Stage | งานหลัก | Output |
|---|---|---|
| **Source** [3466][3470] | Commit / PR trigger [3466][3470] | Pipeline run [3466][3470] |
| **Build** [3466][3468] | Compile / dependency / image [3466][3468] | Artifact [3466][3468] |
| **Test** [3466][3470] | Unit / integration / E2E [3466][3470] | Test report [3466][3470] |
| **Security** [3466][3476] | SAST / dependency scan [3466][3476] | Findings [3466][3476] |
| **Package** [3466][3468] | Tag + push registry [3466][3468] | Versioned artifact [3466][3468] |
| **Deploy** [3466][3470] | Staging / production [3466][3470] | Release [3466][3470] |
| **Verify** [3466][3469] | Smoke / health check [3466][3469] | Pass/fail [3466][3469] |
| **Monitor** [3466][3476] | Metric + alert [3466][3476] | Signal [3466][3476] |

ใช้ pipeline นี้เพื่อคุม quality + speed [3466][3470][3476]

## CI vs CD

| ประเภท | ขอบเขต | Production |
|---|---|---|
| **CI** [3466][3470] | Build + test [3466][3470] | ไม่ deploy [3466][3470] |
| **Continuous Delivery** [3466][3476] | ถึง production-ready [3466][3476] | Manual approval [3466][3476] |
| **Continuous Deployment** [3466][3476] | ถึง production [3466][3476] | Automatic [3466][3476] |

ใช้ CI ก่อน แล้วค่อยขยายเป็น CD [3466][3470][3476]

## Pipeline Config

```yaml
pipeline:
  trigger:
    - "push"
    - "pull_request"

  stages:
    - name: "build"
      steps:
        - "install_deps"
        - "build_image"

    - name: "test"
      steps:
        - "unit"
        - "integration"

    - name: "security"
      steps:
        - "sast"
        - "dependency_scan"

    - name: "deploy"
      steps:
        - "push_registry"
        - "deploy_staging"
        - "deploy_production"
```

ใช้ pipeline as code [3466][3470][3476]

