## Feature Flags

```yaml
feature_flag:
  name: "new_checkout"
  default: false
  rollout:
    - "internal"
    - "5%"
    - "50%"
    - "100%"
```

ใช้ flag เพื่อแยก deploy กับ release [3469][3476][3477]

