## Canary Flow

```text
Deploy v2
   │
   ▼
5% traffic
   │
   ▼
Check metrics
   │
   ├── pass → 25% → 50% → 100%
   └── fail → rollback
```

ใช้ canary เพื่อ progressive delivery [3469][3476][3474]

